  "code": "// Blink an LED wired to GPIO 2 (D2) through a 470 ohm resistor\nconst int LED_PIN = 2;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(LED_PIN, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(LED_PIN, HIGH);\n  delay(500);\n  digitalWrite(LED_PIN, LOW);\n  delay(500);\n}\n"
